        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "Getters (`get`) and Setters (`set`) are special methods in objects or classes that bind an object property to a function. \n- **Getter:** Executes when a property is read. Used to compute values dynamically.\n- **Setter:** Executes when a property is assigned a value. Used to validate or intercept data before saving it to an internal property.",
